      )ERASE FN
∇FN
                        ⍝ OUTPUT   COMMENT
 'HELLO' ⎕ES 0 0        ⍝          Resets ⎕EM and ⎕ET
 ⎕ET                    ⍝ 0 0
                        ⍝
 '2+3' ⎕EA 'A←B)←2)'    ⍝ 5        Causes a syntax error
 ⎕ET                    ⍝ 2 2      Reports 2 2 as the event type
                        ⍝
 'WORLD'⎕ES 0 0         ⍝          Resets ⎕EM and ⎕ET
 ⎕ET                    ⍝ 0 0      Shows ⎕ET reset to 0 0
 'DONE'                 ⍝ DONE
∇

